l.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 09-18-2021, 08:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-19T10:08:17-07:00","id":1460437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1460378-conspiracy-theories-vigil-ascended-when-hunters-win?p=1460398#post1460398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Glad to see this concept picked up and addressed with greater detail.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> I raised a similar question some years back. Never did get very far. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1229562-shards-conspiracy-ascendant\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...racy-ascendant</a> </div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the concepts are similar- even though you dealt more with &quot;how the world would look like if a conspiracy would win&quot; and I with &quot;how can a conspiracy win&quot;- basically, where my idea ends with Sovereignty, you examined the post-Sovereignty setting, even though my way went way more gunzo I think :P Happy you liked it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-19T12:33:52-07:00","id":1460453,"title":"","content":"Absolutely love this idea. I actually greatly struggled to see how any of the conspiracies could reach a tier 4 unless they are connected as heavily to the supernatural as les mysteres (though I'm biased, they are my my top 3 favorite cult- I mean conspiracy).<br /> <br /> Seriously thank for putting in the &quot;blue prints&quot; for this idea. I would love to run a hunter game where true success is possible, and having a believable, not to mention fun and epic, outline makes me think the plays will enjoy it too<br /> <br /> Also your shulpae idea is interesting, and I'm very surprised with the seemingly &quot;good&quot; chieron ending. And saint George scenario is actually scary.<br /> <br /> Edit: is the saint George ending based on the akatsuki goal in naruto?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-20T04:32:36-07:00","id":1460511,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1460378-conspiracy-theories-vigil-ascended-when-hunters-win?p=1460453#post1460453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Absolutely love this idea. I actually greatly struggled to see how any of the conspiracies could reach a tier 4 unless they are connected as heavily to the supernatural as les mysteres (though I'm biased, they are my my top 3 favorite cult- I mean conspiracy).<br /> <br /> Seriously thank for putting in the &quot;blue prints&quot; for this idea. I would love to run a hunter game where true success is possible, and having a believable, not to mention fun and epic, outline makes me think the plays will enjoy it too</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if you find the Blueprints part useful, perhaps a deeper formalism will help you even further? :P<br /> <br /> If you need help in creating Blueprints for Sovereignty, here are the sub steps I'll use to design it-<br /> <br /> <i>Endowments:</i> obviously, the attempt at Sovereignty should utilize the Endowments of the conspiracy as a concept. The AKD would use relics, TFV would design Advanced Armory, the Lucifuge would have hell powers, etc.<br /> <br /> <i>System:</i> the magical and/or religious paradigm which the conspiracy would use in order to achieve their goal. it could be a fictional concept, like the AKD using Labyrinths as their system or the Faithful of Shulpae using Feasts, or one based around real world concepts, like the MM having Catholicism, TVF using Germanic Paganism, the AO using Alchemy or the KoSG having Ars Goetia.<br /> <br /> <i>Mythos:</i> where the system defines the rules, the mythos defines the goal. What is the world as the conspiracy wish it to be? What the conspiracy believes to be its origin and reason for existence? For the AKD, it is Paradise Lost. For the Lucifuge, is Redemption of the Devil. For VASCU, it would be Just Society, while the KoSA have Soldiers of God. What is the conspiracy stands for, basically.<br /> <br /> <i>Symbolism:</i> every conspiracy has some symbols which defines it- choose a couple. Not too many, but not too few. Things which work to emphasis the themes of the conspiracy and which needs to be included in the framework and which draw upon the mythos of the conspiracy. For the AKD, the Shield and Spear are very important symbols, as well as the Scroll, Sword and Temple. To this we added the Bull and the Mistress and Severed Heads, and we have all of the symbols of the group. Notice that while it looks like a lot of symbols, groups of symbols are in fact a single symbol- the Temple would have little meaning without the Scroll and the Sword, and the Bull must come with the Mistress of Honey. Those symbols gain meaning only when they come together, and as such should be coupled as a single symbol in the storyline. Other conspiracies will have their own symbols- the MM, for example, have the Pope, Blood and the original book after which they are named. The KoSG have Dragons, Royalty, The Name Which Shall Not Be Written and the Faceless Angels. The Hototogisu has Cuckoos, thievery and contracts, the AO have the djinn, prophecy and the Cults of the Phoenix and Set and Cheiron, of course, have their logo and centaurs. <br /> <br /> And that's it- combine those features together and you'll get a good basis for a Sovereignty for your chosen conspiracy!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also your shulpae idea is interesting, and I'm very surprised with the seemingly &quot;good&quot; chieron ending. And saint George scenario is actually scary.<br /> <br /> Edit: is the saint George ending based on the akatsuki goal in naruto? </div> </div> </div>I've always assumed that while Cheiron are scary and do terrible things, the powers behind the conspiracy are not &quot;evil&quot; or malicious. They have the theme of healing running through them all across the conspiracy, and it makes sense they came to &quot;heal humanity&quot;, and their Vigil uses monster parts in order to do so. In my head canon, their biggest enemy is the Contagion, which they came to heal. I've detailed my version for them in my Igniting the Fire fan supplement. For a more malicious Sovereignty where a powerful cooperation takes over the supernatural world and binds all monsters through capitalism and submit the whole world for its will, I'll look for the Hototogisu, who are far darker IMO than Cheiron, even if they put a nicer facade.<br /> <br /> As for the KoSG- I didn't finish watching Naruto so while I more or less know what happens there, it didn't really crossed my mind. I've just thought about what kind of world would they try to accomplish, and the result was, as you said, terrifying. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-20T12:57:36-07:00","id":1460572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1460378-conspiracy-theories-vigil-ascended-